# Technical Documentation Page

## Overview

This project is a responsive Technical Documentation Page built using HTML and CSS. It features a navigation sidebar for easy access to different documentation sections and a clean content area for reading technical information.

The project was created to practice semantic HTML, CSS Flexbox layouts, responsive design, and accessibility-focused web development.

## Features

* Responsive layout
* Fixed navigation sidebar
* Structured documentation sections
* Dropdown navigation for subtopics
* Semantic HTML elements
* Mobile-friendly design
* Clean and readable interface

## Technologies Used

* HTML5
* CSS3
* Flexbox
* Media Queries

